node_modules/
dist/
.env
*.local

# Runtime data lives ENTIRELY outside main. main carries only logic + code.
# The agent's own history (threads + beat logs) is version-controlled on a
# separate branch named after the agent (AGENT_NAME, e.g. `aso-dara`), checked
# out as a linked worktree at /.data-branch and pushed there by src/history/commit.ts.
# Everything under /data (history, secrets, tls keys, inbox, poller cursors,
# council clone) is ignored on main.
/data/
/.data-branch/
